      en: ["It is located in close proximity to Parliament Square in downtown Nassau.", "The building serves as the headquarters for the Bahamas Postal Service.", "The architecture features distinct 20th-century British colonial design elements.", "It is the primary location for obtaining special Bahamian philatelic issues.", "The office coordinates mail distribution for the more than 700 islands in the archipelago.", "Portions of the Bahamian Ministry of Finance are also housed within the structure."],
